20) What is the output of the below program? 
class Product
 {
	int x;
	int y;
	public Product(int x,int y) 
                   {
		this.x = x;
		this.y = y;
	}
	public void call()
                     {
		System.out.println("call method called");
	}
}
public class Test14 
{
	public static void main (String[] args) {
		Product p = new Product();
		p.call();
	}
}

Answer:Exception in thread "main" java.lang.Error: Unresolved compilation problem: 
	The constructor Product() is undefined
	
